---

<Layout 
    title="Primärforschungs-Zitate & Wissenschaftliche Bibliographie | Real BMI"
    description="Prüfen Sie direkte Peer-Review-Zitate, klinische Studien und mathematische Gleichungen aller Real BMI-Rechner, einschließlich WHO TRS 854, Lancet 2004 und Mifflin MD 1990."
    canonicalURL="https://realbmicalculator.com/de/sources/"
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
      title="Primärforschungs-Zitate & Wissenschaftliche Bibliographie"
      eyebrow="Evidenzbasierte Medizinische Präzision"
      description="Exakte Peer-Review-Publikationen, institutionelle Berichte und mathematische Modelle aller Algorithmen auf Real BMI."
      returnUrl="/de/"
      returnLabel="Startseite"
    >
      <div class="space-y-10">

        <!-- Executive Rigor Notice -->
        <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] font-medium leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Real BMI verwendet keine intransparenten „Black-Box“-Algorithmen. Jeder Rechner auf dieser Plattform ist direkt in publizierter, von Fachleuten begutachteter klinischer Literatur internationaler Gesundheitsbehörden verankert—darunter die <strong class="text-[var(--foreground)]">Weltgesundheitsorganisation (WHO)</strong>, die <strong class="text-[var(--foreground)]">CDC</strong>, die <strong class="text-[var(--foreground)]">NIH</strong> sowie Fachzeitschriften wie <em class="text-[var(--foreground)]">The Lancet</em> und <em class="text-[var(--foreground)]">The New England Journal of Medicine</em>.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)]">
            Nachfolgend finden Sie unsere vollständige akademische Bibliographie mit direkten PubMed-Identifikatoren (PMID), Digital Object Identifiers (DOI), exakten mathematischen Formeln und zugeordneten Rechnern.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Evidence-Based Guarantee: Exact Studies vs Generic Claims -->
        <section class="p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/5 space-y-5 not-prose shadow-sm" aria-label="E-E-A-T Academic Rigor Policy">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">
                AdSense & YMYL E-E-A-T Konformitätsstandard
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">
              Null-Pauschalaussagen-Richtlinie
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold font-display text-[var(--foreground)]">
              Direkte Primärzitate statt pauschaler Akronyme
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
              In strikter Übereinstimmung mit den Google Quality Rater Guidelines (E-E-A-T für YMYL-Gesundheitsthemen) verzichtet Real BMI auf mehrdeutige Schlagworte wie bloße Verweise auf „WHO“, „CDC“ oder „NIH“. Stattdessen basiert jede Berechnung auf überprüfbaren klinischen Studien mit permanenten PubMed-IDs (PMID), DOIs und transparenten Formeln:
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Direct Comparison Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-red-500/20 bg-red-500/5 space-y-2">
              <span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-500 block">❌ Pauschale Angaben (Auf Real BMI vermieden)</span>
              <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-[var(--muted-foreground)]">
                <li>• Pauschale Erwähnung der „WHO“ für BMI-Grenzwerte</li>
                <li>• Vage Verweise auf „CDC“ für Idealgewicht</li>
                <li>• Bloße Nennung von „NIH“ oder „ACSM“ für Energieumsatz</li>
                <li>• Proprietäre oder unpublizierte Schätzformeln</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 space-y-2">
              <span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 block">✅ Exakte wissenschaftliche Zitate (Auf Real BMI implementiert)</span>
              <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
                <li>• <strong class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">WHO Technical Report Series 854</strong> (PMID 8594834)</li>
                <li>• <strong class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">Lancet 2004; 363: 157–63</strong> (PMID 14726171)</li>
                <li>• <strong class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">Mifflin MD 1990 Resting Energy Expenditure</strong> (PMID 2305711)</li>
                <li>• <strong class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">Mosteller 1987 Body Surface Area</strong> (PMID 3657876)</li>
                <li>• <strong class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">Devine 1974 Ideal Body Weight Equation</strong> (PMID 4819440)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Primary Academic Citation Matrix Table -->
        <section class="space-y-4" aria-label="Academic Citation Matrix Table">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold font-display uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--accent)]">E-E-A-T Evidenz-Matrix</span>
              <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-display text-[var(--foreground)]">Direkte Primärzitate & Mathematische Formeln</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 self-start sm:self-auto">
              15 Primärstudien Indexiert
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="citation-table-wrap border border-[var(--border)] overflow-hidden">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="citation-matrix-table">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Standard / Zitations-ID</th>
                    <th>Herausgebende Institution & Autoren</th>
                    <th>Grundlegende Publikation</th>
                    <th>Klinische Formel / Grenzwert</th>
                    <th>Direktes Zitat</th>
                    <th>Zugeordnete Rechner</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {sources.map((src) => (
                    <tr>
                      <td class="whitespace-nowrap font-medium">
                        <strong class="text-[var(--foreground)] block text-xs sm:text-sm">{src.citationId}</strong>
                        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-[var(--muted-foreground)] uppercase tracking-wide">{src.categoryLabel}</span>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--foreground)] block text-xs">{src.authors}</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] italic block">{src.journal}</span>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <span class="font-medium text-[var(--foreground)] text-xs line-clamp-2" title={src.title}>{src.title}</span>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <code class="font-mono text-[11px] bg-[var(--muted)]/60 px-2 py-1 rounded block text-[var(--foreground)] leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-wrap">{src.keyFinding}</code>
                      </td>
                      <td class="whitespace-nowrap">
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs">
                          {src.doi && (
                            <a 
                              href={src.doi.startsWith('10.') ? `https://doi.org/${src.doi}` : src.url} 
                              target="_blank" 
                              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-bold text-[#464feb] hover:underline"
                            >
                              <span>DOI: {src.doi}</span>
                              <svg class="w-3 h-3 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
                            </a>
                          )}
                          {src.pmid && (
                            <a 
                              href={`https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/${src.pmid}/`} 
                              target="_blank" 
                              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline"
                            >
                              <span>PMID: {src.pmid}</span>
                              <svg class="w-3 h-3 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
                            </a>
                          )}
                          {!src.doi && !src.pmid && (
                            <a 
                              href={src.url} 
                              target="_blank" 
                              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-[#464feb] hover:underline"
                            >
                              <span>Offizielle Publikation ↗</span>
                            </a>
                          )}
                        </div>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                          {src.appliedCalculators.slice(0, 2).map(calc => (
                            <a href={calc.url} class="text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap hover:underline">
                              {calc.name} →
                            </a>
                          ))}
                          {src.appliedCalculators.length > 2 && (
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-[var(--muted-foreground)]">+{src.appliedCalculators.length - 2} more</span>
                          )}
                        </div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Category Filter Tabs -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--border)]" id="sourcesFilterNav">
          <button type="button" class="source-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--accent)] text-white shadow-xs transition-all cursor-pointer" data-filter="all">
            Alle Zitate ({categoryCounts.all})
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="source-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--foreground)] transition-all cursor-pointer" data-filter="anthropometry">
            Anthropometrie & BMI ({categoryCounts.anthropometry})
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="source-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--foreground)] transition-all cursor-pointer" data-filter="metabolism">
            Stoffwechsel & BMR ({categoryCounts.metabolism})
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="source-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--foreground)] transition-all cursor-pointer" data-filter="composition">
            Körperzusammensetzung ({categoryCounts.composition})
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="source-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--foreground)] transition-all cursor-pointer" data-filter="cardiovascular">
            Kardiologie & Sport ({categoryCounts.cardiovascular})
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="source-tab px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--muted-foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] hover:border-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--foreground)] transition-all cursor-pointer" data-filter="nutrition">
            Ernährung & Wasser ({categoryCounts.nutrition})
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Direct Citation Cards List -->
        <div class="space-y-6" id="sourcesList">
          {sources.map((src, index) => (
            <article class="source-card p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--card)] space-y-4 shadow-xs hover:border-[var(--accent)]/50 transition-all" data-category={src.category}>
              <!-- Card Header -->
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-[var(--border)]/60">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)]/15 text-[var(--accent)] font-mono font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">
                    {index + 1}
                  </span>
                  <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)]/10 text-[var(--accent)] text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wider border border-[var(--accent)]/20">
                    {src.citationId}
                  </span>
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[var(--muted)]/50 text-[var(--muted-foreground)] text-xs font-semibold">
                    {src.categoryLabel}
                  </span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
                  {src.doi && (
                    <a 
                      href={src.doi.startsWith('10.') ? `https://doi.org/${src.doi}` : src.url} 
                      target="_blank" 
                      rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/25 font-bold hover:underline"
                    >
                      <span>DOI: {src.doi}</span>
                      <svg class="w-3 h-3 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
                    </a>
                  )}
                  {src.pmid && (
                    <a 
                      href={`https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/${src.pmid}/`} 
                      target="_blank" 
                      rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/25 font-bold hover:underline"
                    >
                      <span>PMID: {src.pmid}</span>
                      <svg class="w-3 h-3 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
                    </a>
                  )}
                  <a 
                    href={src.url} 
                    target="_blank" 
                    rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[var(--accent)] text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shrink-0"
                    aria-label={`Primärstudie ansehen ↗: ${src.citationId}`}
                  >
                    <span>Primärstudie ansehen ↗</span>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Main Citation Details -->
              <div class="space-y-2">
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] leading-snug">
                  {src.title}
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-serif italic text-[var(--muted-foreground)]">
                  {src.authors}. <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--foreground)]/80 not-italic">{src.journal}.</span>
                  {src.doi && <span class="block sm:inline sm:ml-2 not-italic font-mono text-xs text-[var(--accent)]">DOI: {src.doi}</span>}
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Summary & Key Finding -->
              <div class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed font-medium">
                <p>{src.summary}</p>
                <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--muted)]/40 border border-[var(--border)]/70 text-[var(--foreground)]/90">
                  <strong class="text-[var(--accent)] font-display uppercase tracking-wide text-xs block mb-0.5">Klinische Formel / Grenzwert:</strong>
                  <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--foreground)]">{src.keyFinding}</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Applied Calculators on Real BMI -->
              <div class="pt-3 border-t border-[var(--border)]/50 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
                <span class="font-bold text-[var(--foreground)] uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">Auf Real BMI angewendet:</span>
                {src.appliedCalculators.map(calc => (
                  <a 
                    href={calc.url} 
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--muted)] text-[var(--foreground)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] hover:border-[var(--accent)]/40 border border-[var(--border)] transition-colors font-semibold"
                  >
                    <span>{calc.name}</span>
                    <span class="text-[var(--accent)]">→</span>
                  </a>
                ))}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>

      </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>

<style>
  .citation-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background-color: var(--card);
  }
  .citation-matrix-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .citation-matrix-table a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #464feb;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .citation-matrix-table a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .citation-matrix-table tr th,
  .citation-matrix-table tr td {
    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    vertical-align: top;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .citation-matrix-table tr th {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #1f2937;
  }
  :global(.dark) .citation-matrix-table tr th,
  :global(.dark) .citation-matrix-table tr td {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  :global(.dark) .citation-matrix-table tr th {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: #f3f4f6;
  }
  :global(.dark) .citation-matrix-table a {
    color: #818cf8;
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.source-tab');
    const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.source-card');

    tabs.forEach(tab => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const filter = tab.getAttribute('data-filter');

        // Update active tab styles
        tabs.forEach(t => {
          t.classList.remove('bg-[var(--accent)]', 'text-white');
          t.classList.add('bg-[var(--card)]', 'text-[var(--muted-foreground)]', 'border', 'border-[var(--border)]');
        });
        tab.classList.remove('bg-[var(--card)]', 'text-[var(--muted-foreground)]', 'border', 'border-[var(--border)]');
        tab.classList.add('bg-[var(--accent)]', 'text-white');

        // Filter cards
        cards.forEach(card => {
          const category = card.getAttribute('data-category');
          if (filter === 'all' || category === filter) {
            card.style.display = 'block';
          } else {
            card.style.display = 'none';
          }
        });
      });
    });
  });
</script>
